<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak c.bank reserves dip to $3.47 bln - Dec 31.</title>
<headline>Slovak c.bank reserves dip to $3.47 bln - Dec 31.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) on Tuesday said its hard currency reserves dipped to $3.473 billion as of December 31, from $3.546 billion on December 4.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES   Dec 31/96   Dec 4/96   Jan 3/96</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	3.473	 3.546	3.424</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	   2.321	 1.250	1.599</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector    5.794	 4.797	5.024</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
